# ------------------------------------------------------------ the casio

=== ch5_casio
~ clk = 390
->> tick
if end_body:
    @comp room
    @set exchange
    @view ari
    @cam board_outside
    @amb exchange_relays
    On the way up you pass the frame room, and the door's open, so you go in.
    The board is there. Dark wood and brass, forty-two lamps, the tags cut off food packets. Smaller than it was. It was everything, and now it's a thing against a wall that you could get your arms round.
    Your cord is lying in 247, where it lives. You pick it up. The plug is warm from the room and heavier than it ever felt from inside.
    * Put it back in 247.
        ~ cord_home = true
        It goes home with a sound you've heard all night from the other side.
    * Hang it over the Virgin's raised hand, next to Inez's head torch.
        ~ cord_virgin = true
        It hangs there, swinging a little, and stops. Inez will have something to say about that.
    * Hold it a while longer.
        ~ cord_held = true
        You hold it. Nobody's ringing. It's just a plug on a cord in a hand.
    Inez's Casio is on the shelf above the board, where it's always been. The masking tape on it has been crossed out and rewritten underneath: TEST TONES. OR NOT.
    Nobody's here. Nobody needs anything played.
else:
    @comp exchange
    @set exchange
    @view none
    Inez has wired the Casio into 247 before going up to bed, so the keys come through on your line. The masking tape on it has been crossed out and rewritten underneath: TEST TONES. OR NOT.
    Nobody's on the line. Nobody needs anything played.
@casio
if casio_resolved:
    ~ phrase_resolved = true
    SOUND: Five notes. The last one goes down, and stops there, and doesn't want anything after it.
elif casio_played > 0:
    SOUND: A few notes, in the order you wanted them.
else:
    SOUND: Nothing. The keys, and the quiet over them.
Outside, the fog is starting to lift off the courtyard from the top down.
@wait 1.5
if end_appointment == "accepted":
    @ending accept "On Call"
elif end_appointment == "refused":
    @ending refuse "{chosen_name}"
else:
    @ending shared "On Hold"
-> END
